# game/case11.rpy:101
translate japanese press_aya_1_cb87760b:

    # you "Every case?"
    you "すべての事件？"

# game/case11.rpy:103
translate japanese press_aya_1_2af8e21a:

    # aya "Every single one. I printed Case 10 before it happened. That's how fast I am."
    aya "一つ残らず。第十の事件なんて起きる前に刷りましたから。それくらい速いんです。"

# game/case11.rpy:105
translate japanese press_aya_1_b2a39c4b:

    # komachi "That's not how news works."
    komachi "それは報道とは言いません。"

# game/case11.rpy:109
translate japanese press_aya_2_7ac318af:

    # you "Which seven defendants?"
    you "どの七人の被告人ですか？"

# game/case11.rpy:110
translate japanese press_aya_2_fa3ecbfe:

    # aya "Cirno, Marisa, Reisen, Meiling, Alice, Reimu and Kaguya. Very quotable, all of them."
    aya "チルノ、魔理沙、鈴仙、美鈴、アリス、霊夢、それに輝夜。みんな記事映えしますから。"

# game/case11.rpy:112
translate japanese press_aya_2_187f1d7e:

    # komachi "Funny. Every one of them was found guilty."
    komachi "妙ですね。全員、有罪判決を受けた人ばかりです。"

# game/case11.rpy:116
translate japanese press_aya_3_6319ada3:

    # you "Did you ask anyone who was found not guilty?"
    you "無罪になった人には聞きましたか？"

# game/case11.rpy:118
translate japanese press_aya_3_305f6ce1:

    # aya "Why would I? They're happy. Happy doesn't sell papers."
    aya "なぜ聞くんです？あの人たちは満足してますよ。満足じゃ新聞は売れません。"

# game/case11.rpy:122
translate japanese press_aya_4_bc5b3dba:

    # you "Today's edition. Printed when?"
    you "本日号。いつ印刷したのですか？"

# game/case11.rpy:123
translate japanese press_aya_4_5d138dca:

    # aya "Last week. I like to get ahead of things."
    aya "先週です。先手を打つのが好きなので。"

# game/case11.rpy:127
translate japanese press_aya_5_a9163391:

    # you "Seven verdicts. How many cases has this court heard?"
    you "判決が七つ。この法廷はいくつの事件を審理しましたか？"

# game/case11.rpy:129
translate japanese press_aya_5_39a746a7:

    # aya "Seven! ...Seven that matter. Seven that photograph well."
    aya "七つです！……大事なのが七つ。写真映えするのが七つ。"

# game/case11.rpy:131
translate japanese press_aya_5_4989539e:

    # komachi "The boss keeps the docket, Junior Judge. Have a look at it."
    komachi "事件記録は四季様が管理してますよ、見習い判事。見てみてください。"

# game/case11.rpy:135
translate japanese press_aya_6_e4d229ff:

    # you "Every printed verdict is real. What about the ones you didn't print?"
    you "載せた判決はすべて本物。では、載せなかった判決は？"

# game/case11.rpy:136
translate japanese press_aya_6_7afa73e7:

    # aya "Unprinted news isn't news. That's practically the first rule of journalism."
    aya "載らないニュースはニュースじゃありません。ほとんど報道の鉄則ですよ。"

# game/case11.rpy:145
translate japanese case11_b9fe37e6:

    # komachi "Junior Judge. The boss can't sit today. She's the defendant."
    komachi "見習い判事。今日は四季様は席に着けません。被告人なんです。"

# game/case11.rpy:146
translate japanese case11_9981614b:

    # eiki "Bunbunmaru News accuses this court of convicting everyone. A judge cannot hear her own case."
    eiki "文々。新聞は、この法廷が誰でも有罪にすると訴えています。裁判官は自分の事件を審理できません。"

# game/case11.rpy:147
translate japanese case11_4d6f9a74:

    # eiki "So the bench is yours again. I will sit where the defendants sit. It is educational."
    eiki "ですから裁判長席はまたあなたのものです。私は被告人の席に座ります。勉強になりますから。"

# game/case11.rpy:148
translate japanese case11_01ea8da9:

    # komachi "Gavel's yours, Junior Judge. Same as last time. It's still heavy."
    komachi "木槌はあなたのものです、見習い判事。前と同じ。相変わらず重いですよ。"

# game/case11.rpy:152
translate japanese case11_34ebff6a:

    # you "Court is in session."
    you "開廷します。"

# game/case11.rpy:157
translate japanese case11_79a1f4fa:

    # aya "Aya Shameimaru! Bunbunmaru News! Big fan! Mind if I take your picture? Thanks!"
    aya "射命丸文です！文々。新聞！大ファンです！写真撮ってもいいですか？ありがとうございます！"

# game/case11.rpy:162
translate japanese case11_9ab5c611:

    # komachi "She talks fast, Junior Judge. Watch her statements. They won't wait for you."
    komachi "早口ですよ、見習い判事。証言をよく見ていてください。待ってくれませんから。"

# game/case11.rpy:163
translate japanese case11_58896432:

    # eiki "A crowd, a headline, a photograph. None of them is a verdict. Ask what each one leaves out."
    eiki "群衆、見出し、写真。どれも判決ではありません。それぞれが何を省いているかを問いなさい。"

# game/case11.rpy:177
translate japanese case11_1e8e0492:

    # aya_t "Aya Shameimaru, Bunbunmaru News. Fastest reporter in Gensokyo. I've covered every case in this court."
    aya_t "射命丸文、文々。新聞です。幻想郷最速の記者。この法廷の事件はすべて取材しました。"

# game/case11.rpy:178
translate japanese case11_4204a91b:

    # aya_t "I interviewed seven of your defendants. Every one of them says this court is unfair."
    aya_t "被告人を七人取材しました。全員がこの法廷は不公平だと言っています。"

# game/case11.rpy:179
translate japanese case11_cc97f9bf:

    # aya_t "Seven defendants can't all be wrong. The Higan Court is unfair."
    aya_t "七人の被告人がみんな間違っているはずがありません。彼岸法廷は不公平です。"

# game/case11.rpy:194
translate japanese case11_cross_d2ba430c:

    # komachi "Deep breath, Junior Judge. She talks fast. You don't have to."
    komachi "深呼吸してください、見習い判事。彼女は早口ですが、あなたまで急ぐ必要はありません。"

# game/case11.rpy:199
translate japanese case11_cross_98f3d122:

    # you "How many defendants complain doesn't make a verdict unfair. And every one you asked was found guilty."
    you "不満を言う被告人の数で、判決が不公平になるわけではありません。しかも取材したのは全員、有罪になった人です。"

# game/case11.rpy:201
translate japanese case11_cross_b479d266:

    # komachi "Bandwagon. Sustained. ...I've always wanted to say that."
    komachi "多数派論証。異議を認めます。……一度言ってみたかったんです。"

# game/case11.rpy:205
translate japanese case11_cross_a5ee42c9:

    # aya "Fine! Forget the interviews. I have something better. The verdicts themselves."
    aya "いいでしょう！取材の話は忘れてください。もっといいものがあります。判決そのものです。"

# game/case11.rpy:206
translate japanese case11_cross_e62c874a:

    # aya "Front page. Printed and everything. I just need a moment to fetch it."
    aya "一面です。もう刷ってあります。取ってくるので少し時間をください。"

# game/case11.rpy:208
translate japanese case11_cross_8184b6b7:

    # komachi "Court will take a short recess!"
    komachi "しばらく休廷します！"

# game/case11.rpy:233
translate japanese case11_recess_6f90b59a:

    # eiki "A defendant may not investigate her own case, Junior Judge. But a bailiff may run errands."
    eiki "被告人は自分の事件を調べることはできません、見習い判事。でも廷吏が使い走りをするのは構いません。"

# game/case11.rpy:234
translate japanese case11_recess_e779b85b:

    # komachi "Where to, Junior Judge? I'm fast when I want to be. I almost never want to be."
    komachi "どこへ行きましょう、見習い判事？その気になれば速いんですよ。その気になることはまずないですけど。"

# game/case11.rpy:244
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_d9f7121b:

    # komachi "Back. Her desk is a mess. But look: her film roll."
    komachi "戻りました。机は散らかってましたけど、見てください。彼女のフィルムです。"

# game/case11.rpy:246
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_f0b43479:

    # komachi "Thirty-six photos on this roll, Junior Judge. She printed seven."
    komachi "このフィルムには写真が三十六枚あります、見習い判事。印刷したのは七枚。"

# game/case11.rpy:247
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_48f32308:

    # komachi "And this was in her props cupboard."
    komachi "それと、これが小道具棚にありました。"

# game/case11.rpy:249
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_5a7095f6:

    # eiki "The mistress's parasol. Case 06 is not as closed as I thought."
    eiki "お嬢様の日傘。第六の事件は、思ったほど片付いていなかったようですね。"

# game/case11.rpy:253
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_2dfa6ed8:

    # komachi "Got it. The boss's docket. Every verdict, in her handwriting."
    komachi "ありました。四季様の事件記録です。すべての判決が四季様の筆跡で。"

# game/case11.rpy:255
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_3b4c174c:

    # eiki "All of them. Including the ones that don't photograph well."
    eiki "すべてです。写真映えしないものも含めて。"

# game/case11.rpy:259
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_51fb778d:

    # aya "No comment! ...Okay, one comment. The photo never lies."
    aya "ノーコメント！……わかりました、一言だけ。写真は嘘をつきません。"

# game/case11.rpy:265
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_12e5bd7d:

    # komachi "She's back, Junior Judge. With a newspaper the size of a door."
    komachi "戻ってきましたよ、見習い判事。扉くらいの大きさの新聞を持って。"

# game/case11.rpy:279
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_60fc3962:

    # aya_t "Here are this court's verdicts, as printed in today's Bunbunmaru."
    aya_t "これがこの法廷の判決です。本日の文々。新聞に載せた通りです。"

# game/case11.rpy:280
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_4b97ac0f:

    # aya_t "Cirno, Marisa, Reisen, Meiling, Alice, Reimu, Kaguya: guilty, every one. This court convicts everyone!"
    aya_t "チルノ、魔理沙、鈴仙、美鈴、アリス、霊夢、輝夜。全員有罪。この法廷は誰でも有罪にするんです！"

# game/case11.rpy:281
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_96b863dc:

    # aya_t "The photo never lies. Every verdict I printed is real."
    aya_t "写真は嘘をつきません。載せた判決はすべて本物です。"

# game/case11.rpy:285
translate japanese case11_recess_menu_41a98a18:

    # komachi "Your witness, Junior Judge. Slower this time, at least."
    komachi "証人をどうぞ、見習い判事。少なくとも今度はゆっくりです。"

# game/case11.rpy:299
translate japanese case11_cross2_da3256d2:

    # komachi "Again, Junior Judge. Her headline isn't going anywhere."
    komachi "もう一度です、見習い判事。彼女の見出しは逃げませんから。"

# game/case11.rpy:310
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_d79ef59c:

    # you "Your headline prints seven guilty verdicts. This docket has ten cases. You left out every acquittal."
    you "あなたの見出しには有罪判決が七つ。この記録には事件が十。無罪判決をすべて省いていますね。"

# game/case11.rpy:311
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_c07305d6:

    # you "Meiling, not guilty. Mokou, not guilty. Your film roll has their photos. You just didn't print them."
    you "美鈴、無罪。妹紅、無罪。あなたのフィルムには二人の写真もある。ただ載せなかっただけです。"

# game/case11.rpy:314
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_3d439e70:

    # aya "...They weren't exciting! Nobody buys a paper that says \"Court Mostly Fair\"!"
    aya "……面白くなかったんです！「法廷、だいたい公正」なんて新聞、誰が買うんですか！"

# game/case11.rpy:317
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_d0658fd1:

    # komachi "Cherry picking, Junior Judge. Pick the ripe ones, hide the rest."
    komachi "チェリーピッキングですよ、見習い判事。熟した実だけ摘んで、残りは隠す。"

# game/case11.rpy:318
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_8af5fb42:

    # eiki "A handful of true facts, chosen to tell a false story. That is still a lie, Miss Shameimaru."
    eiki "一握りの本当の事実を、偽りの話をするために選ぶ。それでも嘘ですよ、射命丸さん。"

# game/case11.rpy:323
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_d2fa6eb7:

    # you "In the matter of Bunbunmaru News against the Higan Court, this court finds the defendant..."
    you "文々。新聞対彼岸法廷の件につき、当法廷は被告を……"

# game/case11.rpy:334
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_b8f946c5:

    # eiki "Thank you, Junior Judge. And now, a separate matter. Komachi, the parasol."
    eiki "ありがとう、見習い判事。では、別件です。小町、日傘を。"

# game/case11.rpy:335
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_7c22679f:

    # komachi "From her props cupboard, boss."
    komachi "彼女の小道具棚からです、四季様。"

# game/case11.rpy:339
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_8928ec58:

    # aya "Borrowed! For a photo shoot! I left a note!"
    aya "借りただけです！撮影のために！メモも残しました！"

# game/case11.rpy:341
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_c00ee2c5:

    # eiki "Signed \"A.S.\" I remember. Case 06 is reopened. Bailiff."
    eiki "署名は「A.S.」。覚えています。第六の事件を再開します。廷吏。"

# game/case11.rpy:342
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "はいよ、四季様。"

# game/case11.rpy:355
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_b6141252:

    # komachi "...She's gone, boss. Before I even swung."
    komachi "……いなくなりました、四季様。振りかぶる前に。"

# game/case11.rpy:356
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_f87aad9d:

    # aya "Got the shot! \"Bailiff Misses!\" Front page tomorrow!"
    aya "撮れました！「廷吏、空振り！」明日の一面です！"

# game/case11.rpy:363
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_343c4fc9:

    # sakuya "I'll take the parasol, thank you. And the tengu. She's in my other hand."
    sakuya "日傘はいただきます。それと天狗も。もう片方の手にいますから。"

# game/case11.rpy:364
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_4d7f3a72:

    # aya "How did she— I'm the fastest in—"
    aya "どうやって——私は幻想郷最速の——"

# game/case11.rpy:365
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_6e014feb:

    # sakuya "You are. I simply don't use time the way you do."
    sakuya "ええ、そうです。私は時間の使い方があなたと違うだけ。"

# game/case11.rpy:375
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_3ed88655:

    # komachi "...She does that."
    komachi "……あれ、よくやるんです。"

# game/case11.rpy:376
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_4e264560:

    # eiki "Eleven cases, Junior Judge."
    eiki "十一の事件でしたね、見習い判事。"

# game/case11.rpy:377
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_b9f55d4d:

    # eiki "You caught every fallacy on this docket. And twice, you found the truth behind a bad argument."
    eiki "あなたはこの事件記録の誤謬をすべて見破りました。そして二度、悪い論証の陰にある真実を見つけた。"

# game/case11.rpy:378
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_71bf8c82:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. Your work was... more than acceptable."
    eiki "見習い判事。あなたの働きは……及第点以上でした。"

# game/case11.rpy:379
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_42d7cba4:

    # komachi "She's never said that before. Not once."
    komachi "四季様がそんなこと言うの、初めてですよ。一度も聞いたことない。"

# game/case11.rpy:380
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_0d42250e:

    # eiki "Komachi."
    eiki "小町。"

# game/case11.rpy:381
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_bd395515:

    # komachi "Escorting myself out."
    komachi "自分を護送してきます。"

# game/case11.rpy:382
translate japanese case11_breakthrough_3d82d9a4:

    # eiki "Court is adjourned."
    eiki "閉廷します。"

translate japanese strings:

    # game/case11.rpy:14
    old "Bunbunmaru, Today's Edition"
    new "文々。新聞、本日号"

    # game/case11.rpy:14
    old "\"HIGAN COURT FINDS EVERYONE GUILTY!\" Seven verdicts. Seven photos."
    new "「彼岸法廷、全員有罪！」判決が七つ。写真が七枚。"

    # game/case11.rpy:16
    old "The Court's Own Docket"
    new "法廷の事件記録"

    # game/case11.rpy:16
    old "Every verdict, Cases 01 to 10, in Eiki's own hand. Some of them say NOT GUILTY."
    new "第一から第十の事件まで、映姫直筆のすべての判決。いくつかには「無罪」とある。"

    # game/case11.rpy:18
    old "Aya's Film Roll"
    new "文のフィルム"

    # game/case11.rpy:18
    old "Thirty-six frames. Seven printed. The rest: acquittals, a parasol, a sleeping gatekeeper."
    new "三十六枚撮り。印刷されたのは七枚。残りは無罪判決、日傘、眠る門番。"

    # game/case11.rpy:20
    old "The Mistress's Parasol"
    new "お嬢様の日傘"

    # game/case11.rpy:20
    old "From the Bunbunmaru props cupboard. Missing since Case 06."
    new "文々。新聞の小道具棚から。第六の事件から行方不明。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "What the Defendants Say"
    new "被告人たちの声"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "Aya Shameimaru, Bunbunmaru News. Fastest reporter in Gensokyo. I've covered every case in this court."
    new "射命丸文、文々。新聞です。幻想郷最速の記者。この法廷の事件はすべて取材しました。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "Introductions aren't arguments, Junior Judge. Even fast ones."
    new "自己紹介は議論ではありませんよ、見習い判事。速いものでも。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "I interviewed seven of your defendants. Every one of them says this court is unfair."
    new "被告人を七人取材しました。全員がこの法廷は不公平だと言っています。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "That's what she was told. Object to what she makes of it."
    new "それは彼女が聞いた話です。そこから何を導くかに異議を唱えてください。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "Seven defendants can't all be wrong. The Higan Court is unfair."
    new "七人の被告人がみんな間違っているはずがありません。彼岸法廷は不公平です。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "Maybe later. Right now she isn't hiding anything. She's leaning on a headcount."
    new "後でそうかもしれません。今のところ彼女は何も隠していません。頭数に頼っているんです。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "No expert here, Junior Judge. Just seven unhappy voices, counted as proof."
    new "専門家はいませんよ、見習い判事。七つの不満の声が、証拠として数えられているだけです。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "She has seven examples, not one. The trouble is she counts votes instead of checking verdicts."
    new "例は一つではなく七つあります。問題は、判決を確かめずに票を数えていることです。"

    # game/case11.rpy:24
    old "She isn't attacking the boss. She's counting complaints."
    new "四季様を攻撃してはいません。不満を数えているんです。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "The Photo Never Lies"
    new "写真は嘘をつかない"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "Here are this court's verdicts, as printed in today's Bunbunmaru."
    new "これがこの法廷の判決です。本日の文々。新聞に載せた通りです。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "A newspaper is a fact, Junior Judge. What she prints in it is the question."
    new "新聞は事実ですよ、見習い判事。問題は、彼女がそこに何を載せたかです。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "Cirno, Marisa, Reisen, Meiling, Alice, Reimu, Kaguya: guilty, every one. This court convicts everyone!"
    new "チルノ、魔理沙、鈴仙、美鈴、アリス、霊夢、輝夜。全員有罪。この法廷は誰でも有罪にするんです！"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "The photo never lies. Every verdict I printed is real."
    new "写真は嘘をつきません。載せた判決はすべて本物です。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "She's right. Every verdict she printed is real. The trouble is the ones she didn't print."
    new "彼女の言う通りです。載せた判決はすべて本物。問題は、載せなかった判決です。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
    old "Close. But she has more examples than she shows. She picked the ones that fit."
    new "惜しい。でも彼女は見せている以上の例を持っています。都合のいいものを選んだんです。"

    # game/case11.rpy:56
